//! The transfer is [`lightcraft_fetch`] (pure-Rust HTTPS with resume, size and SHA-256 checks), on a background thread,
//! so the UI never waits for the network. Only a model listed in [`lightcraft_faces::known::download`] can be fetched:
//! the address is a pinned constant, never something typed or passed in, and no token is ever sent with it. What arrives
